OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation as woman, 48,
OL,4,Adies after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation is under way
OL,7,Fafter a woman died in a fire in west
OL,8,FLondon, the Metropolitan Police has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to a residential
OL,12,Faddress on Berkley Avenue, Hounslow, at
OL,13,F01:14 BST following reports of the
OL,14,Fblaze.
OL,16,FNine people - six men and three women -
OL,17,Fwere taken to hospital, where the
OL,18,F48-year-old woman died. Another woman,
OL,19,F40, is in a life-threatening condition.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
