OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation as woman, 48,
OL,4,Adies after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met said no arrests had yet been
OL,7,Fmade but officers believed the fire may
OL,8,Fhave been started deliberately. Det Ch
OL,9,FInsp Neil John said: "Our inquiries are
OL,10,Fprogressing at pace as we work to
OL,11,Festablish the full circumstances
OL,12,Fsurrounding the fire."
